<title>JAPAN: BOJ deputy governor to attend BIS meeting.</title>
<headline>BOJ deputy governor to attend BIS meeting.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The deputy governor of the Bank of Japan Toshihiko Fukui will leave for Switzerland on Saturday to attend a Bank for International Settlements (BIS) meeting next week, the BOJ said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Fukui will leave on Saturday and return to Japan next Wednesday.</p>
</text>
